    v56x [label="下一批 6 arm (基底 v551@lr3e-4 / v500@lr3e-4)\n· v556 叠杠杆冲40%+/v557 点w5/v558 focal\n· v559 高lr对照/v560 v500高lr对照/v561 +B2", fillcolor="#CDEEF3"];
